abstract: "Free, open-source BNBC 2020 workflow in the browser: site class from SPT, equivalent static seismic force, analytical wind procedure, load combinations by seismic design category, plane-frame analysis with cracked-section stiffness, and drift, P-Delta, soft-storey, sway and deflection checks."
keywords: [BNBC 2020, Bangladesh National Building Code, seismic load, wind load, frame analysis, storey drift, civil engineering, engineering education]
